      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "The ticket starts blind",
      "items": [
        "Support receives a symptom, never a trace ID",
        "Which team owns the error is a guess, so tickets bounce before they land",
        "Once it lands, the owning engineer starts from the same blank page"
      ]
